        "description": "Cancels the selected appointment at the patient’s request.\n\nRun this after **Get the latest active appointment**, using the same Postman environment.\n\n**Prerequisites**\n\n- `appointmentId` identifies the appointment you intend to cancel.\n    \n- The appointment is eligible for cancellation.\n    \n\n**Request body**\n\n```\n{\n  \"cancelInitiator\": \"PATIENT\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Expected outcome**  \nThe appointment is cancelled. The billing outcome depends on its payment state and the time remaining before its start:\n\n- Paid, with more than 24 hours remaining: cancellation triggers a refund.\n    \n- Paid, with 24 hours or less remaining: cancellation without a refund.\n    \n- Unpaid: cancellation without a refund.\n    \n\nA successful cancellation response does not by itself confirm that a refund has completed. Billing and Stripe process the refund asynchronously.\n\n**Next step:** Get invoice status."
      },
