        "description": "Retrieves the invoice status after patient-initiated cancellation.\n\nUses the same `appointmentId` as **Cancel appointment**. No request body is required.\n\nThe saved examples demonstrate:\n\n- `CANCELLED`: an invoice cancelled without a refund.\n    \n- `REFUNDED`: an invoice after the eligible payment was refunded.\n    \n\nBilling and refund processing are asynchronous. If the previous state is still shown, wait briefly and query again.\n\nKeep the original `appointmentId` throughout the scenario. Do not rerun **Get the latest active appointment** after cancellation, because it may select another appointment."
